---

---

<div id="modal-costo" class="modal-overlay fixed inset-0 z-[210] hidden items-center justify-center p-6" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="costo-titulo">
  <div class="modal-backdrop absolute inset-0 bg-[color:var(--c-noche)]/70 backdrop-blur-md"></div>

  <div class="glass-strong relative w-full max-w-[400px] rounded-2xl px-6 pb-5 pt-6 animate-modal-in">
    <div class="mb-4 grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl" style="background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-dorado) 18%, transparent);color:var(--c-dorado)">
      <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5.5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 000 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 010 7H6.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    </div>

    <h3 id="costo-titulo" class="mb-2 text-[17px] font-bold tracking-tight">Modelo PRO de pago</h3>
    <p class="mb-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--fg-suave)">
      Los modelos marcados como PRO corren sobre APIs de pago. El consumo se cobra a la clave que tenga
      configurada, así que revise sus límites antes de usarlos en una conversación larga.
    </p>

    <div class="mb-5 flex gap-2.5 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed" style="background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--c-dorado) 12%, transparent)">
      <svg class="mt-0.5 shrink-0" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" style="color:var(--c-dorado)"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M8 4.8v3.4M8 11h0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      <span style="color:var(--fg-suave)">Sin clave propia, el proxy del servidor atiende la petición. Igual conviene no abusar.</span>
    </div>

    <label class="mb-5 flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-[13px]" style="color:var(--fg-suave)">
      <input type="checkbox" id="no-mostrar" class="pointer-events-none absolute opacity-0" />
      <span class="check"></span>
      No volver a mostrar este aviso
    </label>

    <div class="flex justify-end gap-2">
      <button id="cancelar-costo" type="button" class="rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold transition-colors hover:bg-[color:var(--card)]" style="color:var(--fg-suave)">
        Cancelar
      </button>
      <button id="aceptar-costo" type="button" class="rounded-xl px-5 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold" style="background:var(--acento);color:var(--c-noche)">
        Entendido
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>